#: includes/brikpanel-access-control.php:567
msgid "My interface"
msgstr "Minha interface"

#: includes/brikpanel-access-control.php:571
msgid "Use the BrikPanel interface for my account"
msgstr "Usar a interface do BrikPanel na minha conta"

#: includes/brikpanel-access-control.php:574
msgid ""
"Turn this off to use the default WordPress and WooCommerce admin for your "
